From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] redate: add an interactive timestamp editor

Add a revision picker that renders jj's topologically grouped graph with
the configured graph style, log node template, and a command-specific row
template. Use the same working-copy-oriented default revset as other
history-editing commands.

Apply exact timestamps through the shared metadata transaction. Preserve
descendant metadata with jj's standard keep signing behavior, and make
signing selected revisions opt-in with --sign.
